<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	CarPlay entitlement key(s) go here once Apple approves the CarPlay entitlement
	request for an appropriate category (see §8b of CaRx_iOS_CarPlay_Development_Prompt.md).
	Xcode adds the correct key automatically when you enable the "CarPlay" capability
	against a provisioning profile that includes it -- do not guess the key by hand.
	Local Simulator testing of the CarPlay scene does not require this entitlement.
	-->
</dict>
